ORGANIZATIONAL ASPECT:
1. Management Structure;
2. Description of important functions; names and qualifications of personnel performing them;
3. Description of administrative procedures and controls.

FINANCIAL ASPECT:
1. Project cost and source/s of financing;
2. Income and cost of sales statement;
3. Balance Sheet;
4. Cash Flow Statement.

TECHNICAL ASPECT:
1. Formula of manufacture involved and specific quality control measures;
2. Expected annual volume of production;
3. Machineries and equipment required;
4. Number of personnel involved in production;
5. Foreign personnel, if any, position and function.

3. Outstanding obligation/liabilities/accounts:
3.1 Unliquidated bonds (indicate name of bonding company, and amount of bonds):
3.2 Unpaid accounts (duties and taxes, indicate amounts and corresponding entry number/s):
3.3 Cargoes/materials which have overstayed (indicate CBW No., description of cargoes/materials, corresponding WSAD No. and peso value) beyond the reglementary period;
3.4 Finished/unfinished products not yet exported beyond the reglementary period;
